            "Substitute $x = 2$ and $y = 5$ into $y = x^3 - x^2 + c$.",
            "Evaluate $5 = 2^3 - 2^2 + c = 8 - 4 + c = 4 + c \\implies c = 1$.",
            "Write the complete curve equation: $y = x^3 - x^2 + 1$."
          ],
          "walkthrough": [
