            },
            {
              "step": 2,
              "text": "Substitute the point $(2, 5)$ into the curve equation:\n$$5 = (2)^3 - (2)^2 + c$$\n$$5 = 8 - 4 + c$$\n$$5 = 4 + c \\implies c = 1$$"
            },
            {
              "step": 3,
